                </svg>
              </a>
            </div>
            <p class="person-meta">Co-Founder & Vision Lead</p>
            <ul class="team-bio">
              <li>Ph.D. in Pure Mathematics from the University of Leeds</li>
              <li>Ex-VC in Hong Kong, Berlin, & London, Most recently as a Talent Investor and later a founder-in-residence with EF</li>
              <li>Professional opera singer trained at the Royal Academy of Music</li>
              <li>Governor at Oxford High School GDST</li>
              <li>EWOR Venture Scout</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="person-card">
            <img src="/about/sedinam.png" alt="Sedinam Simpson" class="person-photo" />
            <div class="person-name-row">
              <p class="person-name">Sedinam Simpson</p>
              <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/sedinam-simpson/" class="event-link" aria-label="Sedinam Simpson on LinkedIn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
